langlang
========

This repository is a fork of langlang, a parsing expression grammar (PEG)
toolkit by Lincoln Clarete (clarete).

  Upstream:    https://github.com/clarete/langlang
  License:     GPL-3.0-or-later (see COPYING)

This fork carries the upstream project's full git history (no squash import)
plus first-party additions — the tomlcst/extract/junction/binary Go
subsystems under go/, the docs/decisions, docs/features, docs/plans, and
docs/references records, and the eng repository conventions (conformist,
this justfile). The upstream copyright and GPL-3.0-or-later license are
retained verbatim in COPYING; modifications in this repository are released
under the same terms.
